.imgix.net/a45d5384/uploads/origins/204ce282-0841-4e5a-b23e-0b36621c8dd0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=b31e78b5c9ed5ba8c23cccd8be25d9ab", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a45d5384/uploads/origins/204ce282-0841-4e5a-b23e-0b36621c8dd0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=b31e78b5c9ed5ba8c23cccd8be25d9ab, https://si.imgix.net/a45d5384/uploads/origins/204ce282-0841-4e5a-b23e-0b36621c8dd0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f2d45dc22f652a299ecf5352cd795b21 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a45d5384/uploads/origins/204ce282-0841-4e5a-b23e-0b36621c8dd0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=23fadb4d1c541324a944662fa5bb07d7 3x"}, "body": "Hello 3Meko-san, my name is Amaebi.\nI was fascinated by the way you draw girls that are too cute, so I would like to make a request!\n\nI would like to ask you to do a FA of a Vtuber, Ebi Tsumugu.\n\nComposition\nThe costume should be a pink china style maid idol costume.\nHer hair color should be red with a light pink inner color. Her hairstyle should be long and fluffy with bangs on both sides and down the front.\nDetails of the hairstyle and costume can be found at the URL.\n\nHairstyle and costume URL\nhttps://x.com/kairou269/status/1887149392874131676?s=46&t=AkZ3GtFKlgdI-fcWXQGrPg\n\nPose, facial expression, and background are left to 3Meko-san.\nI would be happy if you could draw the whole body from head to foot.\n\nThe drawing may be used by Tsumugu Umebi himself for posting on SNS, or as a thumbnail on his monetized YouTube channel, or for videos, etc. I, Amaegi, may use it for personal use, such as wallpaper.\nI, Amaebi, may use it for personal use such as wallpaper.\n\nWe would appreciate it if you could send us PSD and PNG files of the image with and without the address and with the background transparent.\n\nThank you for your consideration.\n\nhttps://lit.link/kairou269", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@sameco_peropero/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2568439, "client_id": 3713366, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/50339c1e/uploads/origins/5e5715d7-1f8b-4375-9c46-2c1f2d58a446?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c850d1a839184fbbd69a30245c77201b", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/50339c1e/uploads/origins/5e5715d7-1f8b-4375-9c46-2c1f2d58a446?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c850d1a839184fbbd69a30245c77201b, https://si.imgix.net/50339c1e/uploads/origins/5e5715d7-1f8b-4375-9c46-2c1f2d58a446?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2b371400538adf9816fff2c523c7adf5 2x, https://si.imgix.net/50339c1e/uploads/origins/5e5715d7-1f8b-4375-9c46-2c1f2d58a446?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e44cef914db29ab069278a7ae8008151 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/50339c1e/uploads/origins/5e5715d7-1f8b-4375-9c46-2c1f2d58a446?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5e4a8144259bf951a6e409e54a85754c", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/50339c1e/uploads/origins/5e5715d7-1f8b-4375-9c46-2c1f2d58a446?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5e4a8144259bf951a6e409e54a85754c, https://si.imgix.net/50339c1e/uploads/origins/5e5715d7-1f8b-4375-9c46-2c1f2d58a446?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=17b230339e8be4731d291cf54fdcefd6 2x, https://si.imgix.net/50339c1e/uploads/origins/5e5715d7-1f8b-4375-9c46-2c1f2d58a446?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=fdf1d0742f9cb1434183ef900ea7237c 3x"}, "body": "Nice to meet you, Mr. 3Meko.\n\nPreparing for vtuber\nMy name is Miku Nekorei.\nI saw your illustration on X and wanted to ask you to draw my V illustration.\nI am preparing to be a vtuber!\n\nV Character Details\nConcept: A cat spirit that descends in the dark of night.\n\nPink hair, twin-tail hair, cat ears, kyonshi\nA little bit young, eyes a little bit pinched\nRed eyes for those with eye patch, purple eyes for those without\nHeart pupils. Mouth with omega eyes\nTwo moles are side by side under the purple eyes.\nBreast size is about C~D. cups\nThere is a tail-like belt instead of a cat's tail. (The tail is short, so you don't have to write it in the illustration.)\nPlease refer to the littlest link for the character image.\n\n\nPoses for illustrations are left up to me.\n\nClothing→We would like to wear different costumes than usual, so we would like you to leave it up to us to draw the costumes according to the time of delivery!\nHalloween, Christmas, etc. Or, you can leave it up to us.\n\n\n\nUsage: Social networking icons, X., YouTube thumbnails, online prints, etc.\nIf possible, we would appreciate it if you could also provide a transparent background for the individual characters so that we can see their ears and hair.\n\nThank you in advance for your consideration.\n\nhttps://lit.link/tokunei_m\n\nhttps://lit.link/tokunei_m", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 2144998, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": false, "name": "にいも🖤コミティアU09a", "screen_name": "8coxox", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1953037534809997312/yDvEtPL0.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1252481725990461440/1754732940/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null